# value, name, version, path
# version is the schema version recorded inside taxa.sqlite by ETE3 (2 for both
# ete3 and ete4), not the version of the package that built the database; the
# data manager fills it in.
# path is the directory that holds taxa.sqlite (and, if ETE3 already built it,
# the taxa.sqlite.traverse.pkl cache); the data manager fills this in for you.
#value	name	version	path
